{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-08-31", "prepared_on": "2026-08-31", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-08-31</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Taiwan Startup Zeabur Data Breach: Hackers Claim to Have Stolen 612GB of Internal Data<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">臺灣新創Zeabur資料外洩，駭客聲稱竊得612 GB內部資料</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Taiwan cloud deployment platform Zeabur disclosed a breach in which its environment variables leaked, causing abnormal API usage for some users' connected AI services. A hacker now claims to have stolen a large trove of Zeabur's internal data.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">臺灣雲端部署平臺Zeabur上週透露環境變數外流，導致部分用戶串接的AI服務使用量異常。有駭客聲稱已從Zeabur竊得大批內部資料。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178540\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Healthcare Giant McKesson Confirms Breach; ShinyHunters Claims Theft of 284 Million Patient Records<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">醫療廠商McKesson證實資料外洩，ShinyHunters宣稱竊取2.84億筆病患相關資料</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Ransomware group ShinyHunters claims it breached a third-party cloud app used by pharmaceutical distributor McKesson, stealing roughly 284 million records. McKesson confirmed the incident but hasn't verified the claimed scale.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">勒索軟體組織ShinyHunters宣稱駭入醫療設備及藥品分銷商McKesson的第三方雲端應用，竊取約2.84億筆資料。McKesson已證實發生資安事件，但尚未確認外洩數量。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178531\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Sony Music, Warner Sue Anthropic, Alleging a \"Brazen Campaign\" of IP Theft<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Sony Music與華納提告Anthropic，指控其大規模侵犯智慧財產權</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Sony Music and Warner filed a broad new lawsuit against Anthropic, centering on accusations of illegal piracy used to train its AI models.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Sony Music與華納對Anthropic提起訴訟，此案範圍廣泛，聚焦於指控其大規模使用非法盜版素材訓練AI模型。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/29/sony-music-warner-sue-anthropic-alleging-a-brazen-campaign-of-intellectual-property-theft/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> OpenAI Plans to End Direct Model Access for Cursor in November<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI計畫11月終止向Cursor直接提供AI模型</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI announced plans to end its contract to directly supply AI models to coding assistant Cursor on November 12, a move possibly linked to SpaceX's acquisition of Cursor.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI宣佈計畫於11月12日終止直接向Cursor提供AI模型的合約，此舉可能與SpaceX收購Cursor有關。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178533\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> cPanel Patches Critical Vulnerability That Could Grant Attackers Full Root Server Access<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">cPanel修補重大漏洞，若未更新可能導致攻擊者取得整臺伺服器Root權限</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">cPanel and WHM released a security advisory patching critical vulnerability CVE-2026-65643, affecting all supported versions. Users should upgrade immediately.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">cPanel與WHM發布公告修補重大漏洞CVE-2026-65643，所有支援版本均受影響，用戶應盡速升級至已修補版本。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178536\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Linux Foundation Takes Over TRACE Governance for Cross-Environment AI Agent Verification<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Linux基金會接手TRACE治理，建立AI代理跨環境互通驗證方式</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The Linux Foundation will take over governance of the open TRACE specification, which turns AI agent execution environments, policies, and tool usage into a verifiable audit trail.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Linux基金會宣布接手TRACE開放規格治理，可將AI代理及機密工作負載的執行環境、政策與工具使用情況，整理成可查驗的執行紀錄。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178521\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Taiwan's Digital Ministry Reviews One Year of Its Five AI Policy Pillars<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">數發部五大AI政策上路一年，林宜敬盤點最新成果</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Taiwan's Minister of Digital Affairs Lin Yi-Ching reviewed progress on five policy tools—computing power, data, talent, marketing, and funding—used to build Taiwan's AI ecosystem and sovereign AI capability.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">數位發展部部長林宜敬說明如何運用算力、資料、人才、行銷、資金五大政策工具，推動臺灣AI產業生態圈與主權AI的進展。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178528\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Google Launches Gemini Omni 1.1 Flash: 40-Second Video Extension with First/Last Frame Control<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google影片生成模型Gemini Omni 1.1 Flash，可延伸40秒並指定首尾影格</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google's new Gemini Omni 1.1 Flash video model adds video extension, first/last frame control, fast 360p drafting, and up to 4K output, now available via the Gemini API.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google推出生成式影片模型Gemini Omni 1.1 Flash，新增影片延伸、首尾影格控制、360p快速草稿與最高4K解析度輸出，已透過Gemini API提供。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178523\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> I Asked 100 Companies for My Data. Some Deleted It Instead.<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">我向100家公司要求調閱個資，結果有些公司直接刪除了它</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A hands-on test of privacy data requests across 100 companies found the process often led to confusion, dead ends, or unexpected deletion instead of disclosure.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">一項針對100家公司的隱私資料請求實測發現，這個流程經常導致混亂、卡關，甚至有公司選擇直接刪除資料而非提供揭露。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/08/i-asked-100-companies-for-my-data-some-deleted-it-instead/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> How to Run a Chatbot on Your Own Computer<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">如何在自己的電腦上運行聊天機器人</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Installing a large language model locally on your personal computer gives you a handy digital assistant without compromising your data privacy.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">在個人電腦上安裝大型語言模型，能讓你擁有一個方便的數位助理，同時不必犧牲資料隱私。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/how-to-run-your-own-local-llm/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}